 "rows": [
  {
   "cue": "a0_c001",
   "line": "a0_c001_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "這裡是小燈鎮。／每年秋天，鎮上都會辦紙燈節。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 7.6,
   "voice_start_s": 7.726,
   "diff_s": -0.126,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c001_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c002",
   "line": "a0_c002_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "喵！大家好，我是折折。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 4.55,
   "voice_start_s": 4.675,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c002_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c002",
   "line": "a0_c002_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "我是燈籠紙摺成的貓，／是阿樂叔叔把我摺出來的喔。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 7.53,
   "voice_start_s": 7.653,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c002_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c002",
   "line": "a0_c002_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "慢慢摺，燈才會亮。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 15.63,
   "voice_start_s": 15.765,
   "diff_s": -0.135,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c002_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c003",
   "line": "a0_c003_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "明天就是紙燈節。／今年的主燈，是照著我的樣子做的！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.15,
   "voice_start_s": 1.273,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c003_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c003",
   "line": "a0_c003_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "可是……主燈的竹子骨架，不見了！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 7.38,
   "voice_start_s": 7.503,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c003_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c003",
   "line": "a0_c003_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "奇怪，我昨天晚上明明放在這裡啊。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 13.5,
   "voice_start_s": 13.623,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c003_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c003",
   "line": "a0_c003_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "沒有骨架，就沒有主燈。／紙燈節怎麼辦？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 18.19,
   "voice_start_s": 18.328,
   "diff_s": -0.138,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c003_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c004",
   "line": "a0_c004_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "阿樂叔叔早！折折早！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 3.35,
   "voice_start_s": 3.472,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c004_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c004",
   "line": "a0_c004_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "骨架不見了？我記下來。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 6.51,
   "voice_start_s": 6.644,
   "diff_s": -0.134,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c004_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c004",
   "line": "a0_c004_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "交給我！我摺成放大鏡，馬上找到！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 12.11,
   "voice_start_s": 12.236,
   "diff_s": -0.127,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c004_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c004",
   "line": "a0_c004_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "呃……謝謝，我剛好缺一頂帽子。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 16.43,
   "voice_start_s": 16.56,
   "diff_s": -0.13,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c004_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c004",
   "line": "a0_c004_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "你們先去上學。／放學再來幫叔叔找，好不好？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 20.22,
   "voice_start_s": 20.355,
   "diff_s": -0.135,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c004_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c004",
   "line": "a0_c004_06",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "好！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 26.36,
   "voice_start_s": 26.482,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c004_06_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c005",
   "line": "a0_c005_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "大家也幫我找，好不好？／看到線索，舉手就好，不用喊出來。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 5.3,
   "voice_start_s": 5.426,
   "diff_s": -0.126,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c005_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c005",
   "line": "a0_c005_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "台口上這八盞燈，每完成一題，／我們就一起點亮一盞。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 11.59,
   "voice_start_s": 11.715,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c005_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a0_c005",
   "line": "a0_c005_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "八盞全亮，小燈鎮就會亮起來！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 16.84,
   "voice_start_s": 16.966,
   "diff_s": -0.126,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a0_c005_03_v04.wav"
  }
 ],
 "all_pass": true
